Package: larva-php
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, php-cgi
Description: A modern PHP application server written in Rust
 LarvaPHP embeds PHP via the Zend Engine C API and serves PHP applications
 through a high-performance asynchronous HTTP server built on Hyper and Tokio.
 .
 It supports multiple config formats (CLI, Apache, Nginx, Caddy), rate
 limiting, hot reload, middleware, X-Sendfile, and a Mercure hub.